        {
          "id": "h1",
          "type": "heading",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Holidays in France"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "h2",
          "type": "heading",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Marco"
            }
          ],
          "level": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "p1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Last June my family and I went to France for our summer holiday. We spent two weeks at a campsite in the south of the country, near Marseilles. There was a beach not too far away but it was very crowded so I spent nearly all my time at the campsite pool, which was much nicer. I met some French kids there and we had a great time together. I really need to work hard on my French though, so that next time it will be easier to talk to people."
            }
          ],
          "image": "imgp1"
        },
        {
          "id": "h3",
          "type": "heading",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Jing"
            }
          ],
          "level": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "p2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "I’d always wanted to visit France, so I was really excited when my parents told me we were going to the city of Caen in the north of the country for our summer holidays last year. There were some lovely beaches not far from the city and we also went to an attractive indoor market, which sold everything from fish to flowers. It was wonderful. However, the best thing we did was a one-day cooking course. I’ve never cooked anything before and it was really fun!"
            }
          ],
          "image": "imgp2"
        },
        {
          "id": "h4",
          "type": "heading",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Tommy"
            }
          ],
          "level": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "p3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "My family always spend our summer holidays in the south of France, and last year we stayed at a campsite on a beach near Arles. I loved swimming in the sea and in the campsite pool. I also enjoyed using my French when we went shopping at the local market. My school friends would be amazed! Because my mum and dad are artists, they wanted to visit a museum about the painter, Van Gogh. Usually I don’t like museums, but actually this one was really interesting."
            }
          ],
          "image": "imgp3"
        }
      ],
